Description: Linux port of the 4k intro Kartoonikum by ExHouse and NecroStudios
 Kartoonikum is a 4k intro by ExHouse and NecroStudios, released at
 Assembly 2007 where it ranked 8th in the PC 4k intro competition.
 .
 This package is built from the source code released by the authors, ported
 to SDL2, and runs in a resizable window (F toggles fullscreen).
